    "result_text": "The full suite is green \u2014 all 32 tests pass, including the new `Cp21Tests`.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change adds an audit log line emitted on a successful `POST /api/owners` create.\n\n**New function step** \u2014 `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AuditOwnerCreated.java`:\n- Obtains the built owner via `@Val Owner` and logs to the dedicated `AUDIT` logger (`LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"AUDIT\")`), including the owner **id**, **customerCode**, and **registrationDate**.\n\n**Pipeline wiring** \u2014 `src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`:\n- Inserted an `audit` step between `save` and `respond`, so it runs after `SaveOwner` (where the generated id is assigned) and before the response is sent. It carries `govern: [ transaction ]` like the surrounding steps.\n\nPlacing it after `save` guarantees the owner's persisted id is populated, and `customerCode`/`registrationDate` were already set by the earlier `AssignCustomerCode` and `BuildOwner` steps. The `registrationDate` logs as ISO `yyyy-MM-dd` (`LocalDate.toString()`), matching the JSON representation the test compares against.\n\nVerified output during the run: `INFO AUDIT - Owner created id=11 customerCode=TOW-SUR-0001 registrationDate=2026-08-17`.",
